url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110250","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110250","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110250.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110250.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-22T18:38:48Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6577 (by covering https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2011).\r\n\r\nThis PR makes so that `Control`s will not show their focus state when activated via a mouse click. It also modifies two functions in order to make this work:\r\n- `Control.grab_focus()` has the new optional argument `hide_focus`.\r\n- `Control.has_focus()` has the new optional argument `ignored_hidden_focus`.\r\n\r\nHere's the full ruleset for when focus is shown or not:\r\n|Situation||\r\n|-|-|\r\n|Clicking a `Control` with the mouse, giving it focus.||\r\n|Successfully switching focus via keyboard/joypad actions.|✅|\r\n|Attempting to switching focus via keyboard/joypad actions but still remaining on the same `Control`.|✅|\r\n|Clicking somewhere with the mouse while having a `Control` with visible focus.||\r\n|Clicking with the mouse a visibly focused `Control` (deviates from how it works in browsers, feedback welcome).||\r\n|Using `Control.grab_focus(true)`.||","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110250/reactions","total_count":24,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110250/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}